WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.392
Before creating a view, make four decisions.

00:00:03.392 --> 00:00:07.337
Choose a meaningful name. Define the row grain.

00:00:07.337 --> 00:00:14.027
Choose the columns intentionally. Then write the select statement that implements that interface.

00:00:14.027 --> 00:00:18.711
Starting with the contract makes the S Q L easier to evaluate.
